{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a feature-complete demo of the upcoming game.<br>It consists of the introductory part of the full game (story-wise).<br>Play time is around 30 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aside from the complete story, the final game might introduce several minor (visual) improvements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo is in English language only.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can expect the assets for this demo to remain mostly unchanged in the full game, i.e.:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sound effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">General story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can interact with the demo in the same way as you would with the full game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Apply various verbs (look, pickup, interact, talk) to entities in the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in dialogues with the characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work your way through puzzles.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3590190?t=1742289196","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3590190?t=1742289196","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590190/f2f18edf449107b403b489d09416ebd80d270077/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742289196","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590190/f2f18edf449107b403b489d09416ebd80d270077/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742289196","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a feature-complete demo of the upcoming game.<br>It consists of the introductory part of the full game (story-wise).<br>Play time is around 30 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aside from the complete story, the final game might introduce several minor (visual) improvements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo is in English language only.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can expect the assets for this demo to remain mostly unchanged in the full game, i.e.:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sound effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">General story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can interact with the demo in the same way as you would with the full game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Apply various verbs (look, pickup, interact, talk) to entities in the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in dialogues with the characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work your way through puzzles.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Duschewno Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3589740","name":"Charlie Spotlight"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590190/36c5e6c21e6cc85fa5ee04bbd75e17467699c3fd/header.jpg?t=1742289196","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x64<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 500 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 215 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></